        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>备忘录 - 交通建议与购机票攻略</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #000;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    max-width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0 0 24px 0;\n  }\n  .topbar {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 18px 22px 10px 18px;\n  }\n  .topbar-left {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n  .back-arrow {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-weight: 300;\n  }\n  .topbar-title {\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .more-btn {\n    width: 34px;\n    height: 34px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 1px solid #6b6b57;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #d8d8c0;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n  .content {\n    padding: 0 18px;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: #22ff22;\n    color: #000000;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    padding: 1px 4px;\n    margin: 22px 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  p.para {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    margin: 0 0 18px 0;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .list-item {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    margin: 0 0 16px 0;\n  }\n  .airline-block {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n    margin: 0 0 16px 0;\n  }\n  .airline-row {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  .airline-row .col {\n    min-width: 200px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <div class=\"topbar\">\n    <div class=\"topbar-left\">\n      <span class=\"back-arrow\">&#8249;</span>\n      <span class=\"topbar-title\">备忘录</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"more-btn\">&#8943;</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\">交通建议：</div>\n\n    <p class=\"para\">公交：出行可以乘坐公交车，投币VX都可以支付。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"para\">电驴：路边店铺租小电驴，或者找路边的共享小电驴也不错，人少方便，适合早上和傍晚，中午太晒了，容易中暑。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"para\">打车：网约车、出租车均可，十几块钱都能去你想去的地方，外地人建议网约车，能知道大概价格路线。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"para\">其他：共享单车/共享电动车，市区，洲岛到处都有很方便，但是要注意停车位置，可能难找。</p>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\">购机票攻略：</div>\n\n    <div class=\"list-item\">1、了解各大航班会员日</div>\n\n    <div class=\"airline-block\">\n      中国国际航空：同月同日(1月1日、2月2日)\n      <div class=\"airline-row\">\n        <span class=\"col\">厦门航空：每月9日</span>\n        <span class=\"col\">东方航空：每月9日</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"airline-row\">\n        <span class=\"col\">山东航空：同月同日</span>\n        <span class=\"col\">海南航空：每月8日</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"airline-row\">\n        <span class=\"col\">深圳航空：每月12日</span>\n        <span class=\"col\">四川航空：每月19日</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"airline-row\">\n        <span class=\"col\">吉祥航空：每月25日</span>\n        <span class=\"col\">南方航空：每月28日</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"list-item\">2、会员日的促销价格可在官网上查询~</div>\n\n    <div class=\"list-item\">3、有些特价航空的机票不提供免费的托运服务和餐食，可以在网上提前购买行李额，并自备好干粮。</div>\n\n    <div class=\"list-item\">4、一次性购买往返机票比分开购买单程票划算。</div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
